    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*

**Numerical footnote**

Footnote references, like [5]_. Note that footnotes may get rearranged, e.g., to the bottom of the "page".

--------

.. [5] A numerical footnote. Note there's no colon after the ``]``.
*)

FUNCTION_BLOCK FB_Libdoc_ManuallyNumberedFootnotes
VAR_INPUT
    nVarA : INT;
    nVarB : INT;
END_VAR
VAR_OUTPUT
    nSum : INT;
END_VAR
VAR
END_VAR
]]></Declaration>
